Scenario: Cancel Repeating Dialog
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent edit Title
		|eventTitle|Calendar Non-Repeating Event 1|
	And CalendarEvent view No Repeating
	And CalendarEvent goto Repeat Configuration
	And KeyPress the value '\ESCAPE' at locator 'CalendarEditEvent#REPEAT_ENDS_NEVER_RADIO'
	And CalendarEvent view No Repeating
	And CalendarEvent view Title
		|eventTitle|Calendar Non-Repeating Event 1|
	And CalendarEvent publish
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|${pageName}|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent edit Title
		|eventTitle|Calendar Non-Repeating Event 2|
	And CalendarEvent view No Repeating
	And CalendarEvent goto Repeat Configuration
	And CalendarEvent select Repeat Frequency
		|frequency|Daily|
	And KeyPress the value '\ESCAPE' at locator 'CalendarEditEvent#REPEAT_ENDS_NEVER_RADIO'
	And CalendarEvent view No Repeating
	And CalendarEvent view Title
		|eventTitle|Calendar Non-Repeating Event 2|
	And CalendarEvent publish
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent edit Title
		|eventTitle|Calendar Non-Repeating Event 3|
	And CalendarEvent view No Repeating
	And CalendarEvent goto Repeat Configuration
	And Button click Cancel
	And CalendarEvent view Title
		|eventTitle|Calendar Non-Repeating Event 3|
	And CalendarEvent view No Repeating
	Then CalendarEvent publish
